# Workbench fork (Gray-Harness). Upstream DSH ships no .npmrc; delete this file to
# restore stock behaviour. Scope: this repository only — the user-level ~/.npmrc is
# deliberately left untouched.
#
# Pin dependency acquisition to a reachable mirror. The stock download endpoints
# (GitHub releases for Electron, electron-builder's own CDN) are unreachable on this
# network, which stalls `pnpm install` and the desktop packaging steps.
electron_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron/
electron_builder_binaries_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron-builder-binaries/
#
# Note: pnpm 11 does not read pnpm-only settings from .npmrc — `verifyDepsBeforeRun`
# lives in pnpm-workspace.yaml. This file only carries npm-style keys such as the
# mirrors above. The Electron binary was installed with ELECTRON_MIRROR exported.
